==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|изо-}} {{i|before certain consonant clusters}}
* {{l|ru|ис-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|из-}} {{i|before vowels and voiced consonants}} 
* {{ru-IPA|ис-}} {{i|before voiceless consonants}} 
* {{ru-IPA|и́з-}} {{i|when stressed, before vowels and voiced consonants}} 
* {{ru-IPA|и́с-}} {{i|when stressed, before voiceless consonants}} 

===Etymology===
Inherited from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*jьz-}}; see {{m|sla-pro|*jьz}} for further information.

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# [[out]] [[from]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[идти́]]|to go}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[исходить|изойти́]]|to emanate, to originate, to come from}}
# when added to a verb, it may form a verb with a sense of completeness, abundance or exhaustion
#: {{uxi|ru|[[укра́сить]]|to decorate}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[изукра́сить]]|lavishly decorate}}
# when added to a verb, it may form a verb with a sense of destruction, ruined due to use
#: {{uxi|ru|[[писа́ть]]|to write}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[исписа́ть]]|write upon, cover with notes, write over}}
# when added to nouns, especially when they have the suffix -ье, it indicates location of an object
#: {{uxi|ru|[[голова́]]|head}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[изголо́вье]]|head of the bed}}
# when added to adjectives for colours, an adverb is formed indicating nuance
#: {{uxi|ru|[[жёлтый]]|yellow}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[изжелта-|и́зжелта-бу́рый]]|yellowish-brown}}
# when added to adjectives, it may form an adverb indicating spatial or temporal properties. Usually in archaic or highly formal style.
#: {{uxi|ru|[[да́льний]]|far, distant}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[и́здали]]|from afar}}
# When added to adverbs, it can form an adverb with a sense of direction for an action
#: {{uxi|ru|[[вну́тренний]]|interior, inner}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[изнутри́]]|from within, from inside}}

